        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Heck, Catherine Cortez Masto\n- Roles: U.S. Representative, U.S. Senator candidate, Attorney General, physician, U.S. Army Brigadier General\n- Places: Nevada, Nevada's 3rd congressional district\n- Events: 2016 Nevada United States Senate election\n\nFacts:\n- Joe Heck was born on October 30, 1961.\n- Joe Heck is an American politician, physician, and U.S. Army Brigadier General.\n- Catherine Cortez Masto served as the 32nd Attorney General of Nevada from 2007 to 2015.\n- Joe Heck served as the U.S. Representative for Nevada's 3rd congressional district from 2011 to 2017.\n- Joe Heck ran for the open Nevada United States Senate seat in 2016 and lost the general election to Democrat Catherine Cortez Masto.",
